       - swaps the button label Kid mode <-> Grown-up mode
       - rewrites jargon to plain words across the page (reversible)
       - hides anything marked class="grown", shows class="kid-only"
       - honors per-element data-kid="plain text" overrides
       - remembers the choice in localStorage so it sticks
     Opt a node out of rewriting with class="nokid" or data-no-kid.
     If you re-render content after load, call window.kidRecollect().
